# Dependencies and build output
# No trailing slash ON PURPOSE. `node_modules/` matches a DIRECTORY only, so a
# SYMLINK named node_modules is not ignored -- and on 27 Aug 2026 a `git add -A`
# swept exactly that into commit 6996b4d and it reached main. Checking the branch
# out then replaced a real node_modules with a dangling link to a path that did
# not exist on the machine doing the checkout. Without the slash, both shapes are
# ignored.
node_modules
dist/

# Playwright (E2E) artifacts
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
.playwright/

# PRIVACY GUARD — Michael's real data must never reach GitHub.
# These patterns block the real backup/sync files in any folder.
*pistol-tracker-sync*.json
*pistol-tracker-backup*.json
*.flog

# OS noise
.DS_Store

# Vite writes an ephemeral timestamp file when loading its config
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*.mjs
